# Prettier also honours .gitignore; these are tracked files it must not touch.

# Platform text rendered VERBATIM (only trimmed) into every instance's
# SOUL.md / AGENTS.md managed sections by `jeeves install`. Prettier's Markdown
# rewrites (*emphasis* -> _emphasis_, added blank lines, joined blockquote
# lines) would change the bytes written to every workspace, so these files are
# hand-formatted and excluded from Prettier.
content/*.md

# Generated by git-cliff (`git-cliff -o CHANGELOG.md` in release-it's
# after:bump hook) and fully regenerated on every release, so a one-off
# reformat would be undone by the next release. Its output (verbatim commit
# bodies, compact list spacing) is not Prettier-shaped.
CHANGELOG.md
